  "name": "Wood Attunement",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/traditions/Wood_Tradition_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You wrap your body in a tangle of vines and roots, allowing you to drink deeply of the energy permeating the world.</p><p>For <strong>1 minute</strong>, you are <strong>Restrained</strong>.</p><p>Your <strong>Armor</strong> increases by <strong>+1</strong> from the flora wrapped around your body.</p><p>Additionally, you gain <strong>+1 bonus dice</strong> on all casting checks to cast spells.</p><p>Each extra success increases the bonus dice by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may extend duration by <strong>+1 minutes</strong> per extra success.</p><p>You may also increase the bonus to <strong>Armor</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> per 2 extra successes.</p>",
